###
The purpose of this test is to ensure that the stack trace for the uncaught exception is in 'bar', not 'foo'.
Previously there was a bug where the exception was treated as a constant, so it had the stack trace from the first time it was thrown.
###
main void()
	try
		foo
	catch e _
		bar

e record exception case
show string(_ e)
	"boo"

foo void()
	throw e

bar void()
	throw e
